  "observations": [
    "The corrected metadata-read-error original now shows the complete safe notice at the bottom of the actual settings viewport. The earlier image and its limitation remain retained.",
    "Actual owned/external and pending save, failed save/source, pinned, gzip-restored, normally restarted and moved/replaced states are visible.",
    "All six keyboard originals show the complete blue pin outline at 760 by 540 using explicit light/dark preferences and 100/125/150 percent zoom. All six error originals show the whole safe notice and unpinned state. The dark 150 percent error capture does not show an outline; the separate pre-submit keyboard capture does.",
    "Long paths wrap at larger zoom; settings content and later categories require vertical scrolling. The replaced directory shows the unverified badge, disabled pin and retained-files explanation."
  ],
  "scope": "Actual local worktree pin UI, strict full-window bridge, write/source/read failures, same-profile gzip restore separation, local restart and replaced-directory rejection. Quick Chat restrictions, cross-profile creation-authority transfer, snapshots, destructive cleanup, full reference parity and current distribution require separate evidence. Complete current source, distribution and post-error focus verification remain separate."
